@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> ExerciseSelected

state ExerciseSelected {
  [*] --> LoadRuntimeConfig
  LoadRuntimeConfig : load ExerciseDefinition
  LoadRuntimeConfig : load optional CalibrationProfile
  LoadRuntimeConfig : load ExerciseParameterSnapshot defaults
}

ExerciseSelected --> SetupChecking : open camera / pose available
SetupChecking --> SetupGuidance : required landmarks missing\nwrong orientation/view\nconfidence unstable
SetupGuidance --> SetupChecking : user repositions phone/body
SetupChecking --> Ready : setup valid for stability window

Ready --> ActiveSet : user taps Start Set
ActiveSet --> TrackingDegraded : invalid tracking exceeds tolerated gap
TrackingDegraded --> ActiveSet : quality valid for recovery window\nrestart from fresh stable movement state
TrackingDegraded --> RepositionRequired : invalid persists
RepositionRequired --> ActiveSet : setup recovers and stabilizes\nrestart from fresh stable movement state

ActiveSet --> RepositionRequired : material camera/view transform change\nor exercise/setup parameter change

ActiveSet --> Finalizing : user taps Stop Set
TrackingDegraded --> Finalizing : user taps Stop Set
RepositionRequired --> Finalizing : user taps Stop Set
Finalizing --> Ready : temporal state finalized\nSetCloseBarrier committed

ExerciseSelected --> [*] : leave workout
Ready --> [*] : leave workout

note right of SetupChecking
This is camera/setup validation, not a claim of exact anthropometric
limb-length measurement from one monocular phone camera.
Height may be user-provided for normalized context; exact limb lengths
must not be invented in centimeters.
end note

note right of Ready
Start Set is enabled only after a stable valid setup window.
Exact confidence/stability thresholds belong in SPEC/tests.
end note

note right of TrackingDegraded
Do not advance rep state, evaluate biomechanics form rules,
or deliver form cues while tracking quality is invalid.
When the tolerated gap is exceeded, TemporalResetCoordinator resets:
- confidence-aware SignalProcessor filter/velocity history,
- ExerciseAnalyzer rep temporal state,
- BiomechanicsMetrics ROM/tempo/path accumulators,
- CompactRepTrace builder state,
- RuleEpisodeTracker active temporal episodes.
A short-lived TrackingEvent records the transition.
end note

note right of RepositionRequired
A material view/transform/setup change is a temporal discontinuity.
Recovery never resumes an interrupted rep as if nothing happened;
it reacquires a fresh stable movement state.
end note

note right of Finalizing
Stop Set first stops new frames, waits for all inference/ordered/analysis work
to quiesce, finalizes rep/metric/rule state, then commits the reserved
SetCloseBarrier(highWatermark). The UI shows saved only after commit ack.
end note

@enduml
